    {
      "id": "blk_b70042db",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "位于今州东南海域的世外净土，因周边海域被迷雾遮蔽，常人难以踏寻。﻿",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
