        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5b5f479e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "﻿据记载，乘霄山是今州先民的祖地，岁主「角」曾降临于此，以时序之力庇护此地不受残象侵扰，因此山中时间流速与外界不同。﻿",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f34467bd",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "﻿早年间，稷廷人曾得机缘赴乘霄秘地探赜索隐，留下诸多研究设施及珍贵资料后，不知所踪。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
